  - local search
  - linear codes
  - group actions
  - LLM-written search programs
abstract: "Explicit covering arrays for 101 parameter sets of the ca-tools covering array table, at strengths 3 to 6; 98 of them hold the best known size on 2026-11-08, including CA(6445; 4, 37, 6) (previous best 7199), CA(3516; 4, 14, 6) (4080), CA(2976; 4, 12, 6) (3944), CA(6254; 4, 29, 6) (6851) and the line CA(N; 4, k, 6) for k = 11 to 39. Obtained by orbit search under PGL(2, q), a family developed under PGL(2, 5) and a cyclic shift of the columns, unions of cosets of linear codes and post-optimisation of the published record arrays, with search programs written by Claude Opus, and verified exhaustively."
